🔒 Key Features

Dockerized Environment: Consistent runtime across Dev and Prod.

Zero-Knowledge Keys: API Keys are hashed (SHA-256) before storage; even admins cannot see them.

Instant Revocation: "Kill Switch" functionality to ban compromised keys immediately.

CORS Configured: Secure communication between Nginx frontend and Spring backend.
